# Users-actions downstream

Journal, descriptors, and last activity call `UsersActionsServiceClient`. Do not register `AdminServiceClient`. Keep camera list and health on `IpCameraServiceClient` and `TranslatorServiceClient`.

```csharp
r.AddGrpcClient<GrpcUsersActions.UsersActionsService.UsersActionsServiceClient>();
r.AddGrpcClient<GrpcIpCamera.IpCameraService.IpCameraServiceClient>();
r.AddGrpcClient<GrpcTranslator.TranslatorService.TranslatorServiceClient>();
```
